.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/426X426/37b7cf6a-ecb6-4143-9cdf-a241a43d694f.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/772X772/37b7cf6a-ecb6-4143-9cdf-a241a43d694f.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/852X852/37b7cf6a-ecb6-4143-9cdf-a241a43d694f.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:Rspqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:Rspqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>La naturlig sollys strømme inn gjennom panoramasoltaket for en mer romslig følelse. Med den vidstrakte himmelen over deg vil du oppleve et bedre synsfelt på hver kjøretur.</p></div></div></div></article><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">JBL lydsystem: Overlegen lydklarhet</h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/9a3f82a4-603b-4cdc-b132-f14ef9bfa7db.JPG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/180X180/9a3f82a4-603b-4cdc-b132-f14ef9bfa7db.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/225X225/9a3f82a4-603b-4cdc-b132-f14ef9bfa7db.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/336X336/9a3f82a4-603b-4cdc-b132-f14ef9bfa7db.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/386X386/9a3f82a4-603b-4cdc-b132-f14ef9bfa7db.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/426X426/9a3f82a4-603b-4cdc-b132-f14ef9bfa7db.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/772X772/9a3f82a4-603b-4cdc-b132-f14ef9bfa7db.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/852X852/9a3f82a4-603b-4cdc-b132-f14ef9bfa7db.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:Rupqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:Rupqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Forbedre lyden til hver sang, podkast eller radiostasjon med JBL® premium-lydsystemet. Dette toppmoderne systemet leverer en ny æra av lydklarhet og gir en lydfølelse som i en konsertsal.</p></div></div></div></article></div><div class="HighlightsSlider__slider-footer--SYzpP"><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">1 / 3</span><div class="HighlightsSlider__slider-buttons--O2XqD"><button type="button" class="Button__btn-arrow--W2kvL Button__btn-default--Zm4fj Button__circle--SrVMP HighlightsSlider__nav-button--aRHBb"><svg class="Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__md--_2kiP Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__icon-chevron-left--kdGPZ" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#chevron-left"></use></svg><span class="Accessibility__sr-only--Jea6c"><span>Forrige slide</span></span></button><button type="button" class="Button__btn-arrow--W2kvL Button__btn-default--Zm4fj Button__circle--SrVMP HighlightsSlider__nav-button--aRHBb"><svg class="Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__md--_2kiP Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__icon-chevron-right--xGAKo" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#chevron-right"></use></svg><span class="Accessibility__sr-only--Jea6c"><span>Neste slide</span></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="SpecsAndHighlights__specs--xaNzY"><section id="carConfigSpecsSpaceAndRoom" aria-label="Plass" class="SpecsAndHighlights__specSection--L4JrO"><p class="Text__support-header-semibold--ok4zj Text__heading-global--rDWeu ColorTypes__grey-7--Vl83B"><span>Bilspesifikasjoner</span></p><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Plass</h3><div class="SpecsDetail__wrapper--khN7a"><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu SpacingTypes__spacing-1--k_0RP">Stoffer av høy kvalitet og myk detaljer gir behagelige menneskelige preg til interiøret ditt, og forvandler kupeen til en innbydende plass der 